    "testimonials_bPAxbw": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "testimonial_J4KxCC": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon_star": "5_star",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "title": "",
            "text": "<h6>It took me 4-5 nights to stop reaching for my old pillow. But now I can't believe how much better I sleep - especially on my side. Even my husband started using it and said his arm doesn't go numb anymore.</h6>",
            "author": "",
            "author_note": "<p><em>- Megha R., Hyderabad</em></p>",
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_mDNQRF": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon_star": "5_star",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "title": "",
            "text": "<h6>At my age, pain doesn't disappear easily. But after about two weeks of consistent use, I could feel less strain in my neck and upper back. It's now part of my nightly routine.</h6>",
            "author": "",
            "author_note": "<p><em>- Latha lyer, Coimbatore</em></p>",
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_pUVbyf": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon_star": "5_star",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "title": "",
            "text": "<h6>At first, the shape felt unfamiliar - I've never used a contoured pillow before. But by day 5 or 6, I noticed I wasn't waking up with that stiff neck anymore. It cradles my neck perfectly, and I finally sleep through the night without tossing.</h6>",
            "author": "",
            "author_note": "<p><em>- Priya M, Chennai</em></p>",
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_EHeDhq": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon_star": "5_star",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "title": "",
            "text": "<h6>I wear a sleep tracker and saw more REM sleep by the second week. The first few days not worse, just new. But now I wake up clearer and with less shoulder felt different stiffness.</h6>",
            "author": "",
            "author_note": "<p><em>- Rohit P, Bengaluru</em></p>",
            "product": ""
          }
        }
      },
